{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"平坦函子"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"平坦函子"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>平坦函子可视为"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦模","text":"平坦模"}},{"Plain":"的推广.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$, 考虑其"},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"米田扩张"}},{"Plain":" $F\\otimes (-)\\colon \\widehat {\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$; 若后者为左正合函子, 即保持有限极限, 则称 $F$ 为<strong>平坦函子</strong>.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>对于函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$, 如下条件等价.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$F$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"元素范畴","text":"元素范畴"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>相关资料</h2>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"盲人摸象","text":"盲人摸象"}},{"Plain":" A.5 节.</p>\n"}]}}